{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-tit-3-1","title":"Titus 3:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"TIT","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Titus is yet further directed by Paul, both concerning the things that he should teach and not teach. 10 He is to reject obstinate heretics. 12 He appoints him time and place wherein he should come unto him.</p>\n<p>Put. Isa 43:26; 1Ti 4:6; 2Ti 1:6; 2Pe 1:12; 3:1,2; Jude 1:5 to be subject. De 17:12; Pr 24:21; Ec 8:2-5; 10:4; Jer 27:17; Mt 22:21; 23:2,3 Ro 13:1-7; 1Ti 2:2; 1Pe 2:13-17 to be ready. 8,14; 2:14; 1Co 15:58; Ga 6:9,10; Eph 2:10; Php 1:11; Col 1:10 1Ti 5:10; 2Ti 2:21; Heb 13:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-tit-3-2","title":"Titus 3:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"TIT","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>speak. Ps 140:11; Pr 6:19; Ac 23:5; 1Co 6:10; 2Co 12:20; Eph 4:31 1Ti 3:11; Jas 4:11; 1Pe 2:1; 3:10; 4:4; 2Pe 2:10; Jude 1:8,10 no. Pr 19:19; 25:24; 1Ti 3:3; 2Ti 2:24,25 gentle. 2Sa 22:36; Isa 40:11; Mt 11:29; 2Co 10:1; Ga 5:22; 6:1; Eph 4:2 Php 4:5; Col 3:12,13; 1Th 2:7; 2Ti 2:24,25; Jas 1:19,20; 3:17 1Pe 3:8 all men. 1Co 9:19; Ga 6:10; 1Th 5:14,15; 1Pe 2:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-tit-3-3","title":"Titus 3:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"TIT","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>we. Ro 3:9-20; 1Co 6:9-11; Eph 2:1-3; Col 1:21; 3:7; 1Pe 4:1-3 foolish. Pr 1:22,23; 8:5; 9:6 disobedient. Mt 21:29; Ac 9:1-6; 26:19,20; Eph 2:2; 1Pe 1:14 deceived. Isa 44:20; Ob 1:3; Lu 21:8; Ga 6:3; Jas 1:26; Re 12:9; 13:14 serving. Joh 8:34; Ro 6:17,22 living. Ro 1:29-31; 2Co 12:20; 2Ti 3:2,3 hateful. Ps 36:2; Re 18:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-tit-3-4","title":"Titus 3:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"TIT","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>the kindness. 2:11; Ro 5:20,21; Eph 2:4-10 love. or, pity. God. 1:3; 2:10; 1Ti 1:1; 2:3; 4:10 appeared. 2:11; 2Ti 1:10; Heb 9:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-tit-3-5","title":"Titus 3:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"TIT","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>by works. Job 9:20; 15:14; 25:4; Ps 143:2; Isa 57:12; Lu 10:27-29; Ro 3:20,28 Ro 4:5; 9:11,16,30; 11:6; Ga 2:16; 3:16-21; Eph 2:4,8,9; 2Ti 1:9 according. 4; Ps 62:12; 86:5,15; 130:7; Mic 7:18; Lu 1:50,54,72,78; Eph 1:6,7 Heb 4:16; 1Pe 1:3; 2:10 washing. Joh 3:3-5; 1Co 6:11; Eph 5:26; 1Pe 3:21 renewing. Ps 51:10; Ro 12:2; Eph 4:23; Col 3:10; Heb 6:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-tit-3-6","title":"Titus 3:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"TIT","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>he shed. Pr 1:23; Isa 32:15; 44:3; Eze 36:25; Joe 2:28; Joh 1:16; 7:37 Ac 2:33; 10:45; Ro 5:5 abundantly. Gr. richly. Eph 4:2; 3:8 through. 1:4; Joh 4:10; 14:16,17; 16:7; Ro 8:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-tit-3-7","title":"Titus 3:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"TIT","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>being. 2:11; Ro 3:24,28; 4:4,16; 5:1,2,15-21; 11:6; 1Co 6:11; Ga 2:16 made. Ro 8:17,23,24; Ga 3:29; 4:7; Heb 6:17; 11:7,9; Jas 2:5; 1Pe 3:7 hope. 1:2; 2:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-tit-3-8","title":"Titus 3:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"TIT","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>a faithful. 1:9; 1Ti 1:15 that thou. Pr 21:28; Ac 12:15; 2Co 4:13 which. Ps 78:22; Joh 5:24; 12:44; Ro 4:5; 1Pe 1:21; 1Jo 5:10-13 be. 1,14; 2:14 good. Job 22:2; 35:7,8; Ps 16:2,3; 2Co 9:12-15; Phm 1:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-tit-3-9","title":"Titus 3:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"TIT","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>avoid. 1:14; 1Ti 1:3-7; 4:7; 2Ti 2:23 unprofitable. Job 15:3; 1Co 8:1; 13:2; 2Ti 2:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-tit-3-10","title":"Titus 3:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"TIT","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>heretick. 1Co 11:19; Ga 5:20; 2Pe 2:1 after. Mt 18:15-17; 2Co 13:2 reject. Ro 16:17; 1Co 5:4-13; Ga 5:12; 2Th 3:6,14; 2Ti 3:5; 2Jo 1:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-tit-3-11","title":"Titus 3:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"TIT","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>is subverted. 1:11; Ac 15:24; 1Ti 1:19,20; 2Ti 2:14; Heb 10:26 being. Mt 25:26-28; Lu 7:30; 19:22; Joh 3:18; Ac 13:46; Ro 3:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-tit-3-12","title":"Titus 3:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"TIT","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Tychicus. Ac 20:4; 2Ti 4:12 be. 2Ti 4:9,21 for. 1Co 16:6,8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-tit-3-13","title":"Titus 3:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"TIT","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>the lawyer. Mt 22:35; Lu 7:30; 10:25; 11:45,52; 14:3 Apollos. Ac 18:24 on. Ac 21:5; 28:10; Ro 15:24; 1Co 16:11; 3Jo 1:6-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-tit-3-14","title":"Titus 3:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"TIT","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>learn. 8 maintain good works. or, profess honest trades. Ac 18:3; 20:35; *Gr: Eph 4:28; 1Th 2:9; 2Th 3:8 that. Isa 61:3; Mt 7:19; 21:19; Lu 13:6-9; Joh 15:8,16; Ro 15:28; Php 1:11 Php 4:17; Col 1:10; Heb 6:6-12; 2Pe 1:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-tit-3-15","title":"Titus 3:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"TIT","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>with me. Ro 16:21-24 Greet. Ro 16:1-20 love. Ga 5:6; Eph 6:23; 1Ti 1:5; Phm 1:5; 2Jo 1:1,2; 3Jo 1:1 Grace. 1Co 16:23; Eph 6:24; 2Ti 4:22; Heb 13:25</p>"}]}